    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.poster.avif?t=1752389690\" width=634 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.webm?t=1752389690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.mp4?t=1752389690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realtime PvP:</strong> defeat your opponent by reaching the right-side of the screen with your slimes! Don't let them reach your side...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:\u00a0</strong>Select Traits as you win rounds, but 3 losses means the run is OVER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gaming:</strong> 45 bonuses to upgrade with &quot;idle&quot; currency earned over time, even when the game is closed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend Rank:\u00a0</strong>Climb the leaderboard based on W-L ratio!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Bragging:\u00a0</strong>See other players run around, and admire their publicly displayed rank... or show off your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/dd396f82c376a6bf46d8ebf1499cb4bd.avif?t=1752389690\" width=489 height=105 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.poster.avif?t=1752389690\" width=634 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.webm?t=1752389690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/bc45349847d3763ab14e9e1c5cafde49.mp4?t=1752389690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realtime PvP:</strong> defeat your opponent by reaching the right-side of the screen with your slimes! Don't let them reach your side...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression:\u00a0</strong>Select Traits as you win rounds, but 3 losses means the run is OVER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gaming:</strong> 45 bonuses to upgrade with &quot;idle&quot; currency earned over time, even when the game is closed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend Rank:\u00a0</strong>Climb the leaderboard based on W-L ratio!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Bragging:\u00a0</strong>See other players run around, and admire their publicly displayed rank... or show off your own!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507960/extras/dd396f82c376a6bf46d8ebf1499cb4bd.avif?t=1752389690\" width=489 height=105 /></span></p>",
